gm-method (static deploy build break fails silently, site freezes at last good build): an unresolved-import or bundle error on a gh-pages / static-site deploy fails the build SILENTLY -- the workflow green-checks but the live site shows the last successful deploy. Green workflow != live-updated. Always browser-witness the deployed page after a static deploy, not just the workflow status. Stage vendored SDK files and re-exported imports into dist explicitly to prevent silent 404s.